"""The twelve gate themes added in 2.1.53, appended after the first six (gen_gate_data.py's THEMES order is the
checkerboard, so these only ever go on the end). Each generator extends its own tables from NEW_THEMES:
gen_gate_data (biome look, red realm ground), gen_gate_rooms (room palette), gen_red_lairs (lair palette; the lair
features, seats and lights of the parent theme), gen_gate_items (name, catalyst) and generate_quests (name).
write_theme_files() writes data/mdvlcraft/gate_themes/<key>.json from the parent theme's file (its mobs, bosses and red
gate stand-ins) with this theme's name, biome, music, catalyst and room lists. Run gen_gate_rooms.py and gen_red_lairs.py
after it; they fill in the room and lair lists.
"""
